[h1]✨ News ✨[/h1]

✅ Visual effect of leaves falling down in main menu;


[h1]🛠️ Changes 🛠️[/h1]

✅ Some words and phrases rewritten in english for better understanding;


[h1]👾 Bugs Fixed👾[/h1]

✅ Spelling errors in en-us;
✅ Gallery background invisible when switching scenes;

👾 Bugs Fixed 👾

✅ Wrong words in English translation;
✅ Rephrasing of some sentences in the English translation;

[h2][b]✨ What's New ✨[/b][/h2]

✅ Added a button to join our Discord in the main menu.


[h2][b]🛠️ Changes 🛠️[/b][/h2]

✅ Version text is now smaller and more subtle;
✅ Visual effect adjusted when attempting to add items with a full inventory.


[h2][b]👾 Bugs Fixed 👾[/b][/h2]

✅ Fixed typos in the Brazilian Portuguese (pt-br) translation;
✅ The achievement for restarting 25 times was not unlocking;
✅ Fixed a misclick issue when advancing the story after closing a cutscene image;
✅ Closing images too quickly caused them to flicker uncontrollably;
✅ The close button in the gallery returned to the menu if clicked too quickly;
✅ After achieving the happy ending and starting a new game, the screen would turn black and freeze;
✅ Pressing F12 no longer brings up a console screen.
